[Music]  bloodshot with vin diesel was released  this year just days before the cinemas  around the world closed their doors  therefore the film about the immortal  elite soldier grey garrison performed  badly  at the box office contrary to  expectations however the film was  surprisingly well received  and as a result was very often bought  and viewed via video on demand  which prompted dmg entertainment to  initiate a sequel  in terms of content the nanotechnology  equipped and quasi immortal elite  soldier  will continue to track down his creator  the rst corporation  garrison can heal himself completely by  using the advanced technology  however the ruthless organization also  controls the thoughts and brain of the  killing machine  the groundwork for the film will  probably be once again the comic series  bloodshot but how exactly dmg will  implement the sequel  is not known at this time nor is an  expected release date  last week it was made clear that johnny  depp and warner brothers will go  their separate ways in the future due to  the abuse allegations against his  ex-wife amber heard  meaning that he will no longer be the  actor of the evil wizard grindelwald  financially however this should not  bother him at all as he will still  receive his eight-figure salary  fans reacted mixedly to deb's retirement  on the one hand many fans jump to the  popular active side and criticize warner  brothers  on the other hand others see the  situation a bit more pragmatically and  wonder  who will succeed him if one believes the  magazine deadline there is already a  clear favorite  casino royale villain mats mikkelsen  although nothing has been decided yet  mikkelsen is probably considered the  favorite of director david yates  but they shouldn't take too much time  either because the production of  fantastic  beasts 3 is already in progress should  mickelson be engaged  one can strongly assume that he'll also  play the wizard gellert grindelwald in  the plan parts 4  and 5 of the fantastic beasts series the  us release of the third part is expected  to be on july 15  2022 in fact many fans had already been  looking forward to the mortal kombat  movie which was supposed to release in  the coming march  on twitter producer todd garner now  reached out to the fans with bad news  since the reboot will not be able to  appear as planned due to the cinema  closures  according to garner there will be a new  date only after it is clear when cinemas  can open again  the same applies to a long-awaited  trailer thus mortal kombat judged on  numerous films that they have no release  date since their postponements  it is to be hoped that the production  team will use the time for fine tuning  and will be able to offer the fans an  even better cinema experience in the end  first through the mummy returns and  later the scorpion  king dwayne johnson became known to a  larger audience in the early 2000s  in addition to his work as a wrestler in  the wwe  it seems that the letter is now being  completely reissued the screenplay is  supposed to have been written by a  straight out of compton author  jonathan herrmann while johnson's  company's seven bucks productions  is working with universal on the  production so he is primarily  responsible for the new movie as a  producer the search for suitable leading  actor and director is still in full  swing  so it is unlikely that johnson will be  seen in a leading role in front of the  camera but that's not unusual because  the four scorpion king sequels all have  different leading actors  jeff snyder of collider does not rule  out the possibility that johnson will be  in front of the camera for a short  appearance in his project  when the reboot will be in the cinemas  is not yet foreseeable  but release before 2022 is considered  very unlikely  given the production status those who  would like to see dwayne johnson on the  big screen  soon can also look forward to disney's  latest family adventure  jungle cruise on july 30th 2021  probably nobody expected this on the  first sad photo of the friendly spider  from the neighborhood  spider-man wears two masks at once  namely a mouth nose covering and his  usual suit the message follows directly  below the picture  apart from that not much seems to have  changed since far from home as at first  glance the suit is identical to the one  from the predecessor  not much is known about the content yet  but many fans are looking forward to the  appearance of jamie foxx's bad guy  electro  and benedict cumberbatch as a new mentor  dr strange  dr strange's knowledge of multiverses  could certainly be beneficial to spidey  as the marvel and sony's universe  collide through the appearance of  electro the release date of spider-man 3  is expected to be december 17th  2021 in 2018 the horror thriller a quiet  place turned out to be one of these  surprise hits of the year  the film about the unyielding and  extremely noise sensitive aliens brought  an impressive  341 million on a budget of just  17 million since then fans have been  eagerly awaiting the completion of part  2  which has been postponed several times  due to cinema closures and will now be  released in  april next year the spin-off mentioned  above will no longer be directed by john  krasinski as in the first two parts  but by midnight special director jeff  nichols this time the story will  probably no longer revolve around the  abbott family  but will shed light on the fate of other  people in the post-apocalyptic world  an exact title and details of the  content are not yet known  the release of a quiet place 3 is  reportedly planned for 2022  bye

